//// The `markdown` package — module-tree root (decision 396; front 142 step 3).
////
//// `markdown`: CommonMark 0.31.2 and the GitHub-flavoured extensions (tables,
//// strikethrough, task lists, extended autolinks, footnotes, the tag filter)
//// parsed to an `MdNode` tree and written as HTML (`toHtml`), with GitHub's
//// heading ids and smart punctuation. `md_text` (code points, character
//// classes, escaping, URL normalisation, entity decoding) and `md_entities`
//// (the HTML5 named references) are the reader's own and private. The tree
//// names no framework (decision 113). See `../AGENTS.md`.
////
//// The `files` ORDER in `botopink.json` is a dependency order: a module is
//// listed before the siblings that import it.

pub mod markdown;
mod md_text;
mod md_entities;
